  "description": "Time trials are decided by margins you can’t feel – only engineer. The Timemachine Mpc. module is built for that reality.\n\nDeveloped with Tudor Pro Cycling Team, every detail is tuned for elite-level output. The rider and bike are treated as one aerodynamic system, validated at 55 km/h and refined until inefficiency had nowhere left to hide. The result is a documented 4% performance gain, delivered through ruthless attention to airflow, power transfer, and position stability.\n\nHandling remains exact at speed, because hesitation costs time. As a Masterpiece model, the Timemachine Mpc is delivered ready to fit the groupset, wheels and extensions of your choice – not because it needs more, but because the rider does.\n\nAfter testing, Stefan Küng summed it up simply: “I love these geeks.” That’s Swiss approval.",
